        "node_id": "n_1_7e5450",
        "thought_text": "Create a grid with A+1 rows and B+1 columns. Fill the first A rows with alternating white and black cells, starting with white, to form A connected white components. Fill the remaining B rows with alternating black and white cells, starting with black, to form B connected black components.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
